&lt;li&gt;free (download): &lt;a href=&quot;https:&#x2F;&#x2F;liquidmirror.itch.io&#x2F;martian-chess&quot;&gt;liquidmirror.itch.io&#x2F;martian-chess&lt;&#x2F;a&gt;&lt;&#x2F;li&gt;
